is, excuse me, it's my limit.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#290","p":12,"im":[],"m":290},{"id":"finddecision_p12_291","t":"Al3cs\n\nLittle hint for all.... IF's teaches that price always move from FL to FL. So when price change his direction, it should be inside a FL where ITs decided that price was too low or too high. Mark the point and look left for that FL. When you do this for enough times you will learn a lot about FLs and about your ability to Read The Market","a":"—","d":"","n":"#291","p":12,"im":[],"m":291},{"id":"finddecision_p12_292","t":"salivan\n\nMadmoney wrote:\n\nsalivan wrote: investigate the chart and prove for your self that which one is important to put weight on it. watch IF's video he answered to all doubts\n\nagain look at the first 20 second of this video,it tell you which one is important: THE FTR TRADE\n\n6867","a":"—","d":"","n":"#292","p":12,"im":[],"m":292},{"id":"finddecision_p12_293","t":"hi madmoney,\n\nthis is my explanation with he draw the Line and why price respected it.\n\nI hope it helps you in your perusal.\n\nis the explanation clear to you?\n\nif not feel free to ask your question.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#293","p":12,"im":["d3eeed179694eb606583351acf55feea99fe5160"],"m":293},{"id":"finddecision_p12_294","t":"corsica\n\nHello fellow RTMers a few decisions.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#294","p":12,"im":["df49b44953464d0318eab506915829d501e9276c"],"m":294},{"id":"finddecision_p12_295","t":"corsica\n\nturning points 5, 6 and 7. Have a great day","a":"—","d":"","n":"#295","p":12,"im":["df49b44953464d0318eab506915829d501e9276c"],"m":295},{"id":"finddecision_p12_296","t":"corsica\n\nI made this trade with a mediocre entry. I came back to it to look at where and why the correct DP was where it was.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#296","p":12,"im":[],"m":296},{"id":"finddecision_p12_297","t":"This is my homework. I appreciate any comments or corrections. I will do more once I get through more threads.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#297","p":12,"im":["d4707424bff1661317702403103000de043009e5","26b8fa139d880787603e30a51a3f16ce444634bf","f27e3d4059e19a22920b596d7ab6e104af695525","8c9c0156ad096ccde393c8b96144541e8ed5623e"],"m":297},{"id":"finddecision_p12_298","t":"","a":"—","d":"","n":"#298","p":12,"im":["91229afb209fe245c725af7684ce92072a135108","1a4eb402062978e1512978e0aa560262328199d5","c21ed7351a480a803d5b32fdce43173bf895d696","56039e499865379451196c2fdd0fd033f4d2b9b9"],"m":298},{"id":"finddecision_p12_299","t":"","a":"—","d":"","n":"#299","p":12,"im":["1fbcbec3127cc067c1865e3b807edc71aff56b9b","ad386fd1b50c35ceabe01fb06b80172db41ca7f8","7c5314742bfc32c51120552fdbb08f53ee5ad226"],"m":299},{"id":"finddecision_p12_300","t":"Edge\n\nHi Nytewyre,. I noticed you sometimes marked the decision to break which is the base just before a barrier like S/R. I am giving you this information because I wasted so much time on conventional S/D trading which teaches these areas are true supply and demand. Erase that from your mind. You will even see how RTM has changed over time. What makes this place great is the fact that even IF and other Masters never sit idle with how they see the market. They adapt. You will love it here!!!\n\nThe true DPs occur seconds after the barrier is broken and it retraces. Its often hidden in the tick chart and makes for a great trap for those S/D traders who swear by peaks and valleys as true supply/demand. The less visible our DP kink the better, especially if it retraces and forms a high/low which makes for a great FO zone.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#300","p":12,"im":[],"m":300}],"images":[{"k":"dcc9b83ef70c52ab954f42cc82f0eca10b085366","t":"assets/thumbs/dcc9b83ef70c52ab954f42cc82f0eca10b085366.webp","f":"assets/images/dcc9b83ef70c52ab954f42cc82f0eca10b085366.jpeg","w":1366,"h":618,"b":57093,"o":"dcc9b83ef70c52ab954f42cc82f0eca10b085366.jpeg","p":12,"pid":"finddecision_p12_285"},{"k":"4da574769c5ddb1170e647d14f6daa24588f052e","t":"assets/thumbs/4da574769c5ddb1170e647d14f6daa24588f052e.webp","f":"assets/images/4da574769